Patch for Wine's wined3d.dll (Wine 11.18) so that Direct3D 11 at feature
level 9_x runs SM4 shader code on the OpenGL renderer on macOS.

macOS stops at OpenGL 4.1, so wined3d caps every D3D11 device at 9_3, and the
game caps ANGLE at 9_3 too. At 9_x, wined3d ignored the SM4 code and
signatures and only used Aon9 (SM2) code, which Wine's compiler never emits
and whose constants the GL backend never receives from D3D11. The SM4 GLSL
path also required EXT_shader_integer_mix (GL 4.5), used only by ftoi/ftou.

Built by scripts/build-wined3d.sh; see docs/building.md.

